            "Toshio": "Strongly advocates for the option with the least paperwork.",
            "Kenji": "Suggests a low base fee to keep it open to newcomers."
          }
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "lines": {
            "Mio": "Points out that tiered systems might be too complex to manage.",
            "Jonathan": "Agrees with Mio, citing the risk of alienating quiet members.",
            "Takumi": "Questions why the regulars should subsidize the inactive.",
